{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04257","headline":"和王记室从赵王春日游陀山寺 · 骆宾王","name":"和王记室从赵王春日游陀山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟旟陪访道，鹫岭狎栖真。\n四禅明静业，三空广胜因。\n祥河疎叠涧，慧日皎重轮。\n叶暗龙宫密，花明鹿苑春。\n雕谈筌奥旨，妙辩漱玄津。\n雅曲终难和，徒自奏巴人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}